## Attribution

SleepFM-Unify builds on the SleepFM research line (Thapa et al., ICML 2024;
related Nature Medicine SleepFM work). Please also cite the upstream SleepFM
papers when using this code. Official SleepFM reference implementation:
https://github.com/rthapa84/sleepfm-codebase

The optional `fourdvarnet/` package is a separate legacy reproduction of
Fablet et al., JAMES 2024 (doi:10.1029/2023MS003609) and is not part of the
SleepFM-Unify paper claim.
